  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added support for .NET 5.0 through .NET 11.\n      Fixes: Find and FindStartsWith return the first match instead of the last; searching all columns searches every column and no longer needs a sorted column; removing the sort works; the chosen sort is kept when the list is reloaded; the default sort is applied when ItemsSource is assigned after load; the first click on a column sorts ascending; clicking the sort arrow sorts.\n      Performance: a header click sorts the list once instead of three times, and adding or removing rows no longer re-sorts the whole list.\n      New: Sorter.SortDirection can be set on a column header to choose its initial direction.",
